{"title":"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Modified_from_Official_Solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Modified from Official Solution)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the number of ordered pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/45265c1272430f31e7fd5a0bc7a4594153eb68c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a+21b=2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d81725a16a0f27701c360a2b1531cc15fec017d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a + 21b \\equiv 2021 \\pmod{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c343d5b638ac1299db927f606910c655df11fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv 1 \\pmod {20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must always be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> cannot go over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/367f6b15d47102fd8fdfc1bafed72c1daeadb35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> because both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26a56b9997555c3e337b0470281a144918afb4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96 \\times 21 = 2016 &lt; 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be524b2b64a943a727a9fa7cc18b2c862a5deb53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$97 \\times 21 = 2037 \\geq 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"182\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> can be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/367f6b15d47102fd8fdfc1bafed72c1daeadb35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Since it must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, it can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6cdde56f366d628a7a35826f98523dbe58bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866b44935f69a5b800547127fe13210bb1e36fbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$61$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. This would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> different numbers.\n</p><p>Alternatively, we could have realized that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/8/f98a2c0f0f45ef5ebc1a776e987adedbe1be6247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80}{20} - \\frac{0}{20} + 1 = 4 - 0 + 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"229\" height=\"38\" />, so adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would also still give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> different numbers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/96023b68a76b9f227f7c5f88e292f9fb4d38078a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a + 21b \\equiv 2021 \\pmod{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/0/090bc95893d3fddf3355bd9f8394799d8143886d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a \\equiv 5 \\pmod {21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/f/d2fbae99ec2eca241bec817abe05dec294581be9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\equiv -5 \\pmod {21} \\equiv 16 \\pmod {21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"264\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must always be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> cannot go above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> because both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c1986d5d61b350794ba561bfa990e1fc0eb0f62b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\times 101 = 2020 &lt; 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"191\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd8776a0046f81ab9e54604ad9b0f369bd5f8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\times 102 = 2040 \\geq 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Since it must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, it can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/78916550838bd31d66e4cdefbc366edb11fd00bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$37$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b784ad3135944214ca7ecade87b8dfa3aa54f1f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd8b908d15627ea3a118bb38668d865edf722170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. This would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> different numbers.\n</p><p>Alternatively, we could have seen that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a7ffbb6afb83135aa20011e1667ea81c807c89c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - 16 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/0/200b891bb51b40274e800474948b2eeb3b57d6be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101 - 16 = 85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> would be the highest and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4e8f9d4d41f72731a5db8a093d63080bc45dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{84}{21} - \\frac{0}{21} + 1 = 4 - 0 + 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"229\" height=\"38\" />, so adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> would still give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> numbers because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/9/ad9a85db88204454e137ffbaca934dd6eb9ec496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84 + 16 = 100 \\leq 101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Modified_from_Official_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Modified_from_Official_Solution)\">Solution 3 (Modified from Official Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Modified from Official Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/9/b495616d24c623cc24ef94c0a1baebc97a32062e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a + 21b \\equiv 2021 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d7ead77387dd1fcf2a22d4e2432dc4bdb90eef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv 1 \\pmod {10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must have a units digit (ones digit) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d2b39529a0fbd11f54b28d7105c62aaf8beace6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 \\times 100 = 2100 &gt; 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"191\" height=\"15\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78ed94215e8e444e06174a1f8666665be7b720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02ee40a14f381cd4b402bfc2e0bc77e3ba6667ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d70b3103927fa495860c770a101491ab2ca85c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/d/52d1aa1f1f7666e5f8a96466854becb066159a3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f927dcca51878875d4f741156993294bb38f382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a536c9f479fa28eda7ecc971d8cb0b2de06c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5ca7583ca0b1dd96bf1952f3944d919526445666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b23f10a96904cad9e9066296f527657c1f94869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1bb7017f48178e5edf8c01a127811305876d60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We also have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16ce0a8fc49aa188e3558ca0f9e73f572bc3acc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a + 21b = 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e6d4c263d00cf63ac2f073aa1757b0089ba31e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/1/141ad24000caa2f7f2fabe040c9175f87aceedd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 1 = 2021 - 21 = 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"324\" height=\"15\" />. This is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this works as a solution because both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive integers. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solution so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78ed94215e8e444e06174a1f8666665be7b720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/0/e004dccbca8c66b5d4a62ff62f64c56d5add5f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 11 = 2021 - 231 = 1790$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this cannot be a solution.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02ee40a14f381cd4b402bfc2e0bc77e3ba6667ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47c0e5c422afcf0047f489cd5985789da25618b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 21 = 2021 - 441 = 1580$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d70b3103927fa495860c770a101491ab2ca85c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, then  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/7/307523850cc8835a98bef9480b2f7e9a2df58b90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 31 = 2021 - 651 = 1370$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this cannot be a solution.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/d/52d1aa1f1f7666e5f8a96466854becb066159a3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9dbfa0f6cf8b1828e03db6a7aaaf24f42371f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 41  = 2021 - 861  = 1160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f927dcca51878875d4f741156993294bb38f382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb38200a14e26cb5f5117d0dbabe069696efb001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 51  = 2021 - 1071  = 950$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this cannot be a solution.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a536c9f479fa28eda7ecc971d8cb0b2de06c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0a031ff80c5900a2e057d96f54dd32e708d44a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 61  = 2021 - 1281  = 740$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5ca7583ca0b1dd96bf1952f3944d919526445666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/586bccc2f7311cb3afae101e587eeb41c56dbc9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 71  = 2021 - 1071  = 530$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this cannot be a solution.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b23f10a96904cad9e9066296f527657c1f94869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fb2c2cc29e20664455d56dbc9e97704901c69ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 81  = 2021 - 1701  = 320$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions so far.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1bb7017f48178e5edf8c01a127811305876d60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e25e036ebc49787cb7b2cdf2aaa5ddb55db08aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21 \\times 91  = 2021 - 1071  = 530$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"342\" height=\"15\" />. This is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that this cannot be a solution.\n</p><p>We then see that we had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> solutions.\n</p><p>We could have also noticed that the tens digit must be even. This is because we would have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/04786aaca0d95033e520020ba4656dcfa1837979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 10x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is some integer (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> had a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c13d602b6a3abbbb7951d1ea3b5a26bbd6b0f305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20a = 2021 - 21b = 2021 - 21(10x + 1) = 2021 - 21 \\times 10x - 21 \\times 1 = 2000 - 21 \\times 10x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"689\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7da0b103ca472d3f8a8af1a91cf7731e21bd94fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 \\times 10x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> would have to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for this to work. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> would have to be even because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is half of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is odd, so it would only work with the ones with even tens digits for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. This means that we would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as the possibilities, meaning that there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> solutions.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC\">2021 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 6 (pa